<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#"
     xml:base="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/"
     xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"
     xmlns:qudt="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
     xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/"
     xmlns:terms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
     xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem">
        <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem/0.1.0"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o#"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/"/>
        <terms:bibliographicCitation>Wexel, H. (2026). The Reprocessing System Ontology for a Circular Factory (Version 0.1.0). Collaborative Research Centre SFB 1574, Karlsruhe Institute of Technology. http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem</terms:bibliographicCitation>
        <terms:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-14</terms:created>
        <terms:creator>Helena Wexel</terms:creator>
        <terms:description xml:lang="en">Funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research Foundation) - SFB 1574 - project ID 471687386.</terms:description>
        <terms:license rdf:resource="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"/>
        <terms:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-15</terms:modified>
        <terms:publisher xml:lang="en">Collaborative Research Centre SFB 1574 Circular Factory for the Perpetual Product, Karlsruhe Institute of Technology (KIT)</terms:publisher>
        <terms:title xml:lang="en">The Reprocessing System Ontology for a Circular Factory</terms:title>
        <vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>rps</vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>
        <vann:preferredNamespaceUri>http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#</vann:preferredNamespaceUri>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Domain ontology of SFB 1574 subproject C02 (Reprocessing System). Formerly drafted under the namespace https://w3id.org/circularfactory/C02#. It extends the Circular Factory Core Ontology with the resources, processes, operations, process parameters, in-process observations, monitoring datasets and data-driven models of the semi-autonomous additive-subtractive reprocessing of unique metallic components (high-speed DED-LB/M combined with machining) in the InRePro cell.
Reuse strategy: Core, SOSA and PROV-O are imported. QUDT is referenced but not imported because of its size; load the QUDT schema and the quantity-kind and unit vocabularies into the triple store separately. Terms of the Perpetual Product Ontology are referenced but not imported, because version 0.0.1 re-declares Core properties with conflicting domains and ranges. The alignment to DOLCE+DnS Ultralite is provided in the separate module reprocessing-system-dul-alignment.ttl.
Extension point for causal knowledge (planned): process parameter settings (sosa:Actuation) and observations of deposit characteristics (sosa:Observation) are first-class individuals, so causal relations between them can be added later without changing existing terms.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Reprocessing System Ontology</rdfs:label>
        <owl:versionInfo>0.1.0</owl:versionInfo>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-1 (sensor and measurement classes): rps:Sensor and rps:Measurement are defined locally as specialisations of sosa:Sensor and sosa:Result, as recommended by INF, because it is not yet decided whether every CRC subproject needs cfc:Sensor and cfc:Measurement in the Core. If such classes are added to the Core, rps:Sensor and rps:Measurement are to be aligned to them or deprecated.</skos:editorialNote>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-2 (uncertainty representation): the representation of measurement and prediction uncertainty (qudt:standardUncertainty, rps:hasCoverageFactor, rps:hasConfidenceLevel, rps:hasLowerPredictionBound, rps:hasUpperPredictionBound, rps:hasUncertaintyEvaluationMethod, rps:UncertaintyEvaluationMethod) is accepted by INF for now but must be aligned with the uncertainty models of subprojects B03 and A03.</skos:editorialNote>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-3 (Core consistency): in Core 0.9.0, cfc:Component is unsatisfiable because cfc:hasOrigin has the two domains cfc:Assembly and cfc:Component, which are disjoint. This ontology follows the intended semantics (rps:ReprocessedComponent is a subclass of cfc:Component) and does not work around it. The modelling requirements of the Core are owned by A01; the correction is pending there.</skos:editorialNote>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-4 (Perpetual Product Ontology): version 0.0.1 is referenced but not imported, because it re-declares Core properties with domains and ranges that conflict with Core 0.9.0 (e.g. cfc:hasFinalWorkpiece). To be imported once the two ontologies are harmonised.</skos:editorialNote>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-5 (further domain ontologies): an alignment to Onto3D was requested but not yet carried out because the intended ontology and namespace could not be identified unambiguously. QUDT is referenced but not imported because of its size.</skos:editorialNote>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Annotation properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->


    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher"/>
    


    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote"/>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Object Properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->


    


    <!-- http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind"/>
    


    <!-- http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasUnit -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasUnit"/>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#enablesProcess -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#enablesProcess"/>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#hasInputWorkpiece -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#hasInputWorkpiece"/>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#implementsProcess -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#implementsProcess"/>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#isSubTaskOf -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#isSubTaskOf"/>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#appliesProcessParameterSetting -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#appliesProcessParameterSetting">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessRun"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessParameterSetting"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a process run to a nominal process parameter setting applied in it.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">applies process parameter setting</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#comprisesManufacturingResource -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#comprisesManufacturingResource">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#SpecializedMachineCell"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ManufacturingResource"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates the specialized machine cell to the machines it contains.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">comprises manufacturing resource</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#documentsReprocessingOperation -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#documentsReprocessingOperation">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ReprocessingHistory"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ReprocessingOperation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a reprocessing history to a reprocessing operation it records.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">documents reprocessing operation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasPowderNozzle -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasPowderNozzle">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#HighSpeedDEDMachine"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#PowderNozzle"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a high-speed DED machine to the powder nozzle currently installed on it.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has powder nozzle</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasReprocessingHistory -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasReprocessingHistory">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#Component"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ReprocessingHistory"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a component to its reprocessing history.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has reprocessing history</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasUncertaintyEvaluationMethod -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasUncertaintyEvaluationMethod">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#UncertaintyEvaluationMethod"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a quantity value to the method by which its stated uncertainty was obtained.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has uncertainty evaluation method</rdfs:label>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-2: to be aligned with the uncertainty models of B03 and A03.</skos:editorialNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isAssessedByObservation -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isAssessedByObservation">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DepositQualityState"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a deposit quality state to an observation or prediction on which its evaluation is based.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is assessed by observation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isComputedFromMonitoringDataset -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isComputedFromMonitoringDataset">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#used"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessMonitoringDataset"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates an observation whose result was derived by feature extraction to the raw dataset it was computed from.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is computed from monitoring dataset</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isCurrentlyMountedOn -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isCurrentlyMountedOn">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isHostedBy"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#MeasurementSystem"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ManufacturingResource"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a measurement system to the manufacturing resource on which it is currently mounted. Relevant for portable systems such as the acoustic emission system. Replaces the middleware term &apos;currentlyMountedOn&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is currently mounted on</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isDepositedDuringRun -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isDepositedDuringRun">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasGeneratedBy"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DepositedLayer"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#AdditiveDepositionRun"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a deposited layer to the additive deposition run that produced it.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is deposited during run</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isDepositedOnWorkpiece -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isDepositedOnWorkpiece">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DepositedLayer"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#Workpiece"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a deposited layer to the workpiece it was built onto.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is deposited on workpiece</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isObservedDuringProcessRun -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isObservedDuringProcessRun">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessRun"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates an observation to the process run during which the observed phenomenon occurred.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is observed during process run</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isStepOfReprocessingOperation -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isStepOfReprocessingOperation">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#isSubTaskOf"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessRun"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ReprocessingOperation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a process run to the reprocessing operation it belongs to. Replaces the middleware term &apos;partOfReprocessingOperation&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is step of reprocessing operation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isTrainedOnMonitoringDataset -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isTrainedOnMonitoringDataset">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DataDrivenProcessModel"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessMonitoringDataset"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a data-driven process model to a dataset used for its training.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is trained on monitoring dataset</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#reprocessesComponent -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#reprocessesComponent">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#hasInputWorkpiece"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ReprocessingOperation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#Workpiece"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a reprocessing operation to the component it reprocesses. The component identity is managed by production control. The range is cfc:Workpiece; the middleware draft used cfc:Resource, which is disjoint with cfc:Workpiece in Core 0.9.0.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">reprocesses component</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#usesInputObservation -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#usesInputObservation">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasInformedBy"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ModelBasedPrediction"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a model-based prediction to an observation used as model input.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">uses input observation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#usesInputParameterSetting -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#usesInputParameterSetting">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasInformedBy"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ModelBasedPrediction"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessParameterSetting"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a model-based prediction to a process parameter setting used as model input.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">uses input parameter setting</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#usesPowderFeedstock -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#usesPowderFeedstock">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#used"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#AdditiveDepositionRun"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#MetalPowderFeedstock"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates an additive deposition run to the powder batch it consumed.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">uses powder feedstock</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#wasRecordedByMeasurementSystem -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#wasRecordedByMeasurementSystem">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessMonitoringDataset"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#MeasurementSystem"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a process monitoring dataset to the measurement system that recorded it.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was recorded by measurement system</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#wasRecordedDuringProcessRun -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#wasRecordedDuringProcessRun">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasGeneratedBy"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessMonitoringDataset"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessRun"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a process monitoring dataset to the process run in which it was recorded.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was recorded during process run</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Data properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->


    


    <!-- http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/standardUncertainty -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/standardUncertainty"/>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCausticOvality -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCausticOvality">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#PowderCausticImageStack"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Shortcut for the second Fourier order of the powder caustic cross-section (dimensionless) derived from a powder caustic image stack. Kept for compatibility with the C02 middleware (&apos;causticOvality&apos;); the canonical representation is an observation of rps:CausticOvality.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has caustic ovality</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DataDrivenProcessModel"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The coefficient of determination R² of a data-driven process model on its training data.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has coefficient of determination</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The confidence level (between 0 and 1) associated with an expanded uncertainty or a prediction interval.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has confidence level</rdfs:label>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-2: to be aligned with the uncertainty models of B03 and A03.</skos:editorialNote>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The coverage factor k used to obtain an expanded uncertainty from the standard uncertainty (qudt:standardUncertainty) according to the GUM.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has coverage factor</rdfs:label>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-2: to be aligned with the uncertainty models of B03 and A03.</skos:editorialNote>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ReprocessingOperation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The completion time of a reprocessing operation as estimated by the specialized machine cell and reported to production control. Replaces the middleware term &apos;estimatedCompletionAt&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has estimated completion time</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DepositedLayer"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The position of a deposited layer in the build-up sequence, starting with 1.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has layer index</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The lower bound of the prediction interval of a model-based prediction, in the unit of the quantity value.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has lower prediction bound</rdfs:label>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-2: to be aligned with the uncertainty models of B03 and A03.</skos:editorialNote>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasMaterialDesignation -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasMaterialDesignation">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#MetalPowderFeedstock"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The standardised designation of the powder alloy, e.g. a material number.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has material designation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasOCTLayerHeight -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasOCTLayerHeight">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#OCTMeasurementSeries"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Shortcut for the mean layer height in micrometres derived from an OCT measurement series. Kept for compatibility with the C02 middleware (&apos;layerHeight&apos;); the canonical representation is a process monitoring observation of rps:LayerHeight with a qudt:QuantityValue result.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has OCT layer height</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasPowderBatchIdentifier -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasPowderBatchIdentifier">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#MetalPowderFeedstock"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The batch or lot number of a powder feedstock.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has powder batch identifier</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasPredictiveCoefficientOfDetermination -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasPredictiveCoefficientOfDetermination">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DataDrivenProcessModel"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The cross-validated coefficient of determination (Q² or R²pred) of a data-driven process model.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has predictive coefficient of determination</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasRawDataFormat -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasRawDataFormat">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessMonitoringDataset"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The file format of the raw data, e.g. HDF5, CSV or TDMS.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has raw data format</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasRawDataStorageLocation -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasRawDataStorageLocation">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessMonitoringDataset"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The location (URI or path) under which the raw data of a process monitoring dataset are stored. Replaces the middleware term &apos;storageLocation&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has raw data storage location</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasSpectralLag -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasSpectralLag">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#EmissionSpectrumLog"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Shortcut for the spectral lag in milliseconds between a laser power step and the emission response, derived from an emission spectrum log. Kept for compatibility with the C02 middleware (&apos;spectralLag&apos;); the canonical representation is an observation of rps:SpectralLag.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has spectral lag</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasStepOrder -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasStepOrder">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ProcessRun"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The position of a process run within its reprocessing operation. Replaces the middleware term &apos;stepOrder&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has step order</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasUpperPredictionBound -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasUpperPredictionBound">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The upper bound of the prediction interval of a model-based prediction, in the unit of the quantity value.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has upper prediction bound</rdfs:label>
        <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">OPEN ISSUE OI-2: to be aligned with the uncertainty models of B03 and A03.</skos:editorialNote>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


